{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-21T10:57:36.715Z","data":{"text":"Task 3 complete.\n\n**Changed**\n- `src/core/show.ts`: added exported `PlanningSessionDetail` and a required `planningSessions` field on `SpecDetails`. `getSpecDetails` now reads `.run/plan.jsonl` via the shared `readPlanningSessions` correlator, keeps start-anchored sessions in `plan_started` order, and maps only sessionId/startTime/harness/model/agent/exitCode/wallSeconds (no `usage` tokens or `briefHash`). `formatSpecDetails` renders a `Planning Sessions:` section before `Event Timeline:`, with `formatDuration` wall times and explicit `unavailable` for null exit/wall.\n- `tests/show.test.ts`: three new tests covering correlation order across active/archived changes, optional agent, unmatched start, malformed/unknown records, exclusion of token/artifact data, section ordering, explicit unavailable values through `formatShowOutput`/`showCommand`, and missing/malformed logs leaving tasks and timelines intact.\n\n**Verification**\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/show.test.ts` → 9/9 pass.\n- `pnpm tsc --noEmit`, `pnpm test`, `pnpm lint` → all pass.\n\n**Deviated**: orphan `plan_exited`-only records are filtered from display (a session needs a `plan_started` for identity/start time); unmatched starts are retained with null exit/wall, as acceptance line 4 requires.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/035-planning-telemetry-and-cycle-time/.run/results/3.md`."}}
